###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/.well-known/agent-card.json


### 非流式：JSON-RPC 2.0 格式，一次性返回完整 JSON 结果。
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/a2a
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "req-1",
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "长沙今日天气"
        }
      ],
      "messageId": "msg-1791528883788",
      "contextId": "thread-1791528874280",
      "kind": "message"
    }
  }
}


### 流式：method 改为 message/stream，Accept 必须是 text/event-stream，返回 SSE 事件流。
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/a2a
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "req-2",
  "method": "message/stream",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "长沙今日天气"
        }
      ],
      "messageId": "msg-1791529003601",
      "contextId": "thread-1791528874280",
      "kind": "message"
    }
  }
}